  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GDLN Program Monitoring and Evaluation System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this Grant is to assist African governments who have invested in setting up Development Learning Centers affiliated with the Global Development Learning Network (GDLN) in developing tools appropriate to plan, monitor and implement policies and structures suitable to ensure these projects yield the intended results going forward and to decide on possible expansion projects.  To strengthen the capacity of the Global Development Learning Network (GDLN) to design and develop a monitoring and evaluation system to plan, monitor and evaluate policies and programs of activities to ensure they yield the intended results.</narrative>
  </description>
